# Mobile app environment. Copy to apps/mobile/.env. Owner: mobile team.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are bundled into the app and visible to anyone: never put secrets here.

# Base URL of the PawCare API, without a trailing slash.
# Leave unset in development to use the computer running `expo start` on port 3000.
# Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3000   iOS simulator: http://localhost:3000
# Physical phone: http://<your computer's LAN IP>:3000 (same Wi-Fi; allow port 3000 in your firewall)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:3000
